# Added 2026-09-03 — discovered missing entirely during the platform-module-lifecycle branch's
# live verification: `platform module install`'s new require_clean_worktree guard (repo.py — the
# first platform-cli command that refuses to run against ANY uncommitted change, including
# untracked files, not just modified ones) tripped on __pycache__ directories left over from
# `pip install`/`pytest` runs, which had nowhere to be ignored because this repo never had a root
# .gitignore at all. Confirmed via `git ls-files | grep -E "__pycache__|\.pytest_cache|..."` that
# nothing junky was ever actually committed — this is purely "add the missing file," not a cleanup
# of already-tracked cruft (a .gitignore can't retroactively un-track something already committed
# anyway; `git rm --cached` would be the tool for that, not needed here).

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Generated, never committed — build-and-push-gateway's CI step (ci.yml) regenerates this on every
# gateway build via `platform module build-index` (ui-shell-plan.md item 6). See
# src/core/gateway/app/config.py's static_module_index_path and README.md's "Running it locally"
# for running the generator by hand.
src/core/gateway/app/module_catalog.json

# Secrets / local config — never commit these
*.env
.env.*
# Exceptions to .env.* above (ui-shell-plan.md item 3, feature/ui-shell-oauth):
# Vite's own convention is to COMMIT .env.production/.env.example (baked into
# the build, cluster-constant, nothing secret in them — see .env.production's
# own comment) and gitignore only the developer's real .env. That deliberately
# differs from the Python services' convention the .env.* rule above was
# written for; these two are the first files in this repo that need it.
!src/core/ui-shell/.env.production
!src/core/ui-shell/.env.example
bootstrap/.env
kubeconfig*
*.kubeconfig
sealed-secrets-private-key.yaml

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Helm
charts/**/charts/
charts/**/*.tgz

# Node / ui-shell (feature/ui-shell-scaffold, 2026-09-04) — .env.local and friends are already
# covered by the .env.* pattern above, not duplicated here.
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.vite/
